{"lines": ["Deja de chillar, pinche pendejo, tu cel está muerto porque eres un culero descuidado.", "Cómo cargar un teléfono.", "Empuja el cable a la chingada pared, no seas tan verga de esperar un milagro.", "Mete esa mamada al puerto, aunque el cabrón tenga más mugre que tu conciencia.", "Rézale al hijo de puta cargador mientras la energía sube lento como tu pinche inteligencia.", "Si el aparato suelta una mierda de chispazo, al menos te libras de ver tu cara de puto mediocre."], "words": [["Deja", 0.0, 0.197], ["de", 0.232, 0.29], ["chillar,", 0.325, 0.848], ["pinche", 0.952, 1.184], ["pendejo,", 1.219, 1.788], ["tu", 1.916, 2.043], ["cel", 2.078, 2.194], ["está", 2.229, 2.357], ["muerto", 2.392, 2.67], ["porque", 2.705, 2.868], ["eres", 2.891, 3.007], ["un", 3.065, 3.111], ["culero", 3.146, 3.402], ["descuidado.", 3.437, 4.098], ["Cómo", 4.377999999999999, 4.586999999999999], ["cargar", 4.621999999999999, 4.864999999999999], ["un", 4.899999999999999, 4.946999999999999], ["teléfono.", 4.980999999999999, 5.619999999999999], ["Empuja", 5.899999999999999, 6.270999999999999], ["el", 6.293999999999999, 6.340999999999998], ["cable", 6.398999999999998, 6.6309999999999985], ["a", 6.653999999999999, 6.676999999999999], ["la", 6.700999999999999, 6.746999999999999], ["chingada", 6.804999999999999, 7.222999999999999], ["pared,", 7.257999999999998, 7.675999999999999], ["no", 7.849999999999999, 7.930999999999998], ["seas", 7.965999999999998, 8.093999999999998], ["tan", 8.139999999999997, 8.256], ["verga", 8.325999999999997, 8.581], ["de", 8.604999999999997, 8.651], ["esperar", 8.674, 8.953], ["un", 8.998999999999999, 9.046], ["milagro.", 9.068999999999999, 9.602999999999998], ["Mete", 9.883, 10.068000000000001], ["esa", 10.103000000000002, 10.219000000000001], ["mamada", 10.254000000000001, 10.510000000000002], ["al", 10.533000000000001, 10.579], ["puerto,", 10.637, 11.16], ["aunque", 11.253, 11.462], ["el", 11.485, 11.530999999999999], ["cabrón", 11.600999999999999, 11.879999